COMMENT ON TABLE analytics.drive_chain_transitions IS 'League drive-state transition matrix per era. Written by scripts/compute_drive_chain.py; design docs/plans/2026-08-08-drive-chain-ep-model-plan.md. p_shrunk = empirical-Bayes shrink toward the parent state (distance dimension dropped, then zone) so starved cells inherit their parent distribution.';


