COMMENT ON VIEW api.conference_comparison IS 'Conference-level aggregate metrics with percentile rankings. One row per conference-season. Enables SEC vs Big Ten comparisons. non_conf_win_pct = record against other conferences. std_dev_sp measures parity (lower = more competitive balance).';


