COMMENT ON COLUMN stats.rushing_player_season.power_success IS 'Power-situation (short-yardage / goal-line) success count across charted attempts for this player this season. NULL means none of the attempts have been charted for this metric yet; rushing_yards_available is the charting-coverage denominator.';


