COMMENT ON COLUMN stats.rushing_team_season.defense__ppa IS 'Average predicted points added (PPA) per charted attempt for this team''s rushing defense this season (what opposing rushing offenses did against them). NULL means none of the attempts have been charted for this metric yet; defense__rushing_yards_available is the charting-coverage denominator.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN rushing_team_season.defense__total_ppa; Type: COMMENT; Schema: stats; Owner: -
