COMMENT ON COLUMN stats.rushing_team_season.defense__total_ppa IS 'Sum of predicted points added (PPA) across charted attempts for this team''s rushing defense this season (what opposing rushing offenses did against them). NULL means none of the attempts have been charted for this metric yet; defense__rushing_yards_available is the charting-coverage denominator.';


