COMMENT ON COLUMN stats.rushing_team_season.defense__line_yards IS 'Average line yards (yards created at or behind the line of scrimmage, CFBD methodology) per charted attempt for this team''s rushing defense this season (what opposing rushing offenses did against them). NULL means none of the attempts have been charted for this metric yet; defense__rushing_yards_available is the charting-coverage denominator.';


