--

COMMENT ON COLUMN ncaa.rosters.ncaa_player_id IS 'stats.ncaa.org''s own player id -- RE-ISSUED EVERY SEASON, verified: cross-referencing 82 players common to Alabama''s 2024 and 2025 rosters by name, every one carries a different ncaa_player_id between the two seasons (e.g. Vito Perri: 8626995 in 2024, 9240713 in 2025). NOT an ESPN/CFBD id, and not stable across seasons even within this schema -- never join across seasons on this column alone.';


